<title>USA: COLUMBIA/HCA COMPLETES VALUE HEALTH MERGER.</title>
<headline>COLUMBIA/HCA COMPLETES VALUE HEALTH MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp on Wednesday said it completed its merger with Value Health Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction was finalized Wednesday when Columbia purchased the outstanding shares of Value Health, which is based in Avon, Connecticut, for $20.50 each.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
